{"_id":"dZOpVB6pY9JXAqKt","name":"Temporal Manifestation","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/temporal_manifestation.webp","items":[{"_id":"mffkjeXr9GGFl1h2","name":"Darkvision","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":400000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"PLmItdUST0MI7STe","name":"Force Healing","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":100000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The temporal manifestation bends the laws of space and time to repair itself. Force damage heals a temporal manifestation rather than dealing damage.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"3fLqcgqBhFDMX7Do","name":"Singularity","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":200000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When the temporal manifestation is destroyed, it implodes into a singularity before disgorging any swallowed creatures and disappearing from existence. Nearby creatures are sucked toward the being and feel as though they are being ripped apart. Creatures within 15 feet of the temporal manifestation take [[/r 3d6[force]]] damage and must attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:19|name:Singularity DC|traits:damaging-effect, evocation, force, occult|showDC:gm]{Fortitude} save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is sickened 1, and is pulled to an empty space adjacent to the temporal manifestation.</p>\n"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["force","occult"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"zDkzM1UV1QSLZyOr","name":"Slow Aura","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Compendium[pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.v61oEQaDdcRpaZ9X]{Aura} 30 feet.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Creatures that start their turn in the aura must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:19|name:Slow Aura DC|traits:aura, time|showDC:gm]{Will} save. On a failure, the creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}; on a critical failure, the creature is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. A creature that succeeds its save is immune to slow aura for 24 hours.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","time"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"TgoFBIBptzP24zAA","name":"Time Step","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":350000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round;</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The temporal manifestation opens a rift in space-time, disappearing from its current space and reappearing in a free space within 30 feet. This movement does not trigger reactions.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["occult","teleportation"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"A6g0wlXA2vT6eS1f","name":"Swallow Whole","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":600000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Medium, [[/r (3d6 + 3)[force]]] damage, Rupture 10. Creatures swallowed by a temporal manifestation are subsumed into a unique temporal pocket. This temporal pocket has no dimensions, so the temporal manifestation can fit any number of Medium or smaller creatures within itself.</p>\n<p>Time does not function normally within the temporal pocket. Each round at the beginning of its turn, a swallowed creature must succeed at a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:19|name:Swallow Whole DC|showDC:gm]{Fortitude} save; on a failure, the creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} that round instead of @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1}. Creatures who suffocate within the temporal pocket do not die, but rather remain @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} in a kind of stasis, never aging, until the temporal manifestation is destroyed or another trapped creature ruptures the temporal manifestation. Once the temporal manifestation ruptures, all creatures in the pocket dimension fall out; unconscious creatures regain consciousness but are @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} from the sudden shift in the laws of time.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwallowWhole]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"swallow-whole","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.uJSseLa57HZYSMUu","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"OSLrOPMSkFd1SXTX","name":"Tendril","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"lcujwfjkkor7w0gea8r4":{"damage":"2d6+5","damageType":"force","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":15},"attackEffects":{"value":["grab"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"fbhDEiqJtuTEg01t","name":"Energy Bolt","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["force","range-increment-60"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":